WEBVTT

00:06:29.427 --> 00:06:30.636
and he'd ask,

00:06:30.636 --> 00:06:32.596
"Are you going to live today?

00:06:33.556 --> 00:06:36.100
I'm going to live today, are you?"

00:06:37.393 --> 00:06:39.395
At first, I didn't get it.

00:06:39.728 --> 00:06:42.273
But then he started to win me over.

00:06:42.273 --> 00:06:45.943
He was a guy who approached the game
in the exact opposite way that I did.

00:06:45.985 --> 00:06:48.112
He was taking the challenge head on.

00:06:48.404 --> 00:06:51.157
He was fully present, right in the moment.

00:06:51.657 --> 00:06:55.744
Right in my face, just live.

00:06:56.537 --> 00:06:59.748
These ideas were a counterweight
to all my doubts.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.375
And wouldn't you know it?